From ffa590b97dc963cef4ec78b6eb27971ab1ee390f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:04:30 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 09/11] apps/notifications: group iOS notifications by sender

With the multi-link experiment, Group by Sender also covers ANCS
notifications from the iPhone and the secondary iPad. The group key is
the iOS app identifier and the sender, so the same name in two apps
stays in two groups; only the sender is shown.

While grouping is on, a notification opened from the list shows only
itself, and a group shows only its own messages; Back returns to the
list. New notifications are not added to such a view.

Signed-off-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Assisted-by: LLM
